      "text": "                Creating object of String class\n              ===============================\n\nclass Test{\n     public static void main(String [] args){\n        String  str;\n        str=new String(\"Prateek\");\n        System.out.out.println(str);\n     }\n}\n\n     OUTPUT\n    =========\n     Prateek",
